      "text": "The Erasmus programme combines criminology with law, sociology, psychology and empirical research methods. UCR offers one explicitly crime-focused course, Criminal Law & Criminal Justice. The broader UCR programmes therefore approach questions of crime and justice through related fields such as law, psychology, sociology, politics, philosophy, conflict, history and media, rather than reproducing a full criminology curriculum."
